# Copy into the root of each project.
# Windows git and Linux git (in the sandbox) share one working tree; normalizing to LF
# stops both sides from seeing phantom line-ending changes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
